<title>INDIA: India to set up panel for rupee convertibility.</title>
<headline>India to set up panel for rupee convertibility.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India said on Friday it was asking the Reserve Bank of India to set up a panel of experts to pave the way towards making the rupee convertible on capital account.</p>
</text>
